    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d795">

                <pb facs="0752" n="636" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg636"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 894.001 M98/26</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Minister for Foreign Affairs to the
                        Japanese Ambassador</hi>.</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[Read and presented by the Ambassador, August 14.]</p>
                <p>The appointment of Mr. Knox has been duly confirmed by the United States
                    Ambassador. You are consequently requested to say to the President that I
                    hastened to inform His Imperial Majesty of the President’s appointment of Mr.
                    Knox, Secretary of State, as his Special Ambassador to attend the funeral of His
                    late Majesty. His Imperial Majesty was much gratified to learn of this very
                    exceptional manifestation of high esteem and regard in which His late Majesty
                    was held by the President, and His Imperial Majesty commands that you express to
                    the President his cordial appreciation of this mark of respect and sympathy. You
                    will also assure the President that the appointment of the Secretary of State to
                    this special mission has greatly pleased the Government and people of Japan. You
                    will also assure the Secretary of State that I am sincerely gratified to hear of
                    the appointment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Uchida.</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1912-08-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 12, 1912.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
